dates rust_parameter v1
description "An input whose alias has two underscores in a row. It is the parameter of the date's function, which rustc's lint non_snake_case warns of, so the Rust code and the Wasm module do not build with -D warnings (W001). Every other target takes it as it is"

inputs
  ordered__on : date  range >=2026-01-01 <=2026-01-31

date ship_by = ordered__on
  + 3 days
